@DAMS.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5219

### Register
POST {{DAMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Carolina",
  "email": "ana@dams.com",
  "password": "SUA_SENHA_AQUI",
  "role": "Admin"
}

###

### Login
POST {{DAMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@dams.com",
  "password": "SUA_SENHA_AQUI"
}

###

### Get Admissions
GET {{DAMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admissions
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Admission by Id
GET {{DAMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admissions/{{id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###